        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production NG, at evaporation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production NG, at evaporation plant
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas.;
eb2f4b61-088b-3e90-be3c-4e5fdfd405ef
This dataset describes the gasification of Nigerian natural gas in a European evaporation plant.
Location:  Global data for energy requirements combined with country-specific natural gas characteristics.
Technology: European technology average.
Time period: Data on energy use for the liquefaction stems of a review of common technologies from 2017 and 2019.
Production volume: none
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb2f4b61-088b-3e90-be3c-4e5fdfd405ef.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
